WEBVTT

00:09.990 --> 00:11.910
Rys?

00:12.490 --> 00:14.120
I wanted to protect you.

00:14.120 --> 00:16.830
No matter who you are
or where you come from,

00:16.830 --> 00:18.870
I pledge my life and loyalty to you.

00:19.330 --> 00:21.960
I vow to live with you.

00:22.830 --> 00:23.770
Therefore...

00:24.920 --> 00:29.010
Please keep me by your side, Master.

00:29.720 --> 00:33.050
You're the only one in this world
who believes and stays with me

00:33.720 --> 00:36.350
after I was thrown out into this world.

00:36.350 --> 00:40.560
Having a strong husband
is an honor for female lupines!

00:40.560 --> 00:44.980
I'm going to become the wife
of a person as strong as you.

00:44.980 --> 00:50.700
We became a couple after I rejected
a master-and-servant relationship.

00:50.700 --> 00:54.160
You were pleased with that
and accepted it.

00:54.160 --> 00:57.000
Fenrys, didn't you know?

00:57.000 --> 01:02.750
This man killed your brother,
Fengaryl, and his entire troop!

01:02.750 --> 01:05.750
It was my fault that you became alone.

01:07.920 --> 01:10.490
That's what is called kindness.

01:11.130 --> 01:15.720
I really admire that part of you.

01:17.970 --> 01:26.110
Protecting you who love me became
my purpose in this unfamiliar world.

01:28.150 --> 01:29.440
And yet...

01:33.200 --> 01:36.410
You have mastered
Primordial Light and Dark spells.

01:37.290 --> 01:38.620
I won't forgive you.

01:40.080 --> 01:41.330
Sir Flio?

01:43.730 --> 01:47.550
You are the only one I won't forgive!

01:55.030 --> 01:57.450
Turning back to a specified period of time.

02:10.690 --> 02:22.460
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:37.200 --> 03:38.740
#6: HIYA THE DJINN OF LIGHT AND DARKNESS
How?

03:38.740 --> 03:41.280
#6: HIYA THE DJINN OF LIGHT AND DARKNESS
How can a mere human be able

03:41.280 --> 03:42.910
to use a Time-Reversal spell?

03:43.320 --> 03:44.370
Who are y—

03:48.670 --> 03:50.380
H-How dare you!

03:50.920 --> 03:54.960
You dare to lay a hand on me
who achieved the pinnacle of magic!

03:59.610 --> 04:01.430
Stop talking.

04:02.390 --> 04:03.850
Primordial Dark!

04:08.390 --> 04:09.770
It's dispelled?

04:10.730 --> 04:12.730
What are you exactly?

04:14.650 --> 04:15.990
What's this?!

04:15.990 --> 04:19.700
No way...
All his skills are infinite?!

04:23.660 --> 04:26.200
The defensive spell is useless...

04:36.050 --> 04:37.090
What happened to me?

04:37.090 --> 04:38.970
Lady Rys, are you all right?

04:38.970 --> 04:41.200
Y... Yeah.

04:41.200 --> 04:42.470
What's going on exactly?

04:42.930 --> 04:44.970
There isn't a single wound on me.

04:44.970 --> 04:47.890
I think it was thanks to Sir Flio's magic.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.020
However...

04:50.900 --> 04:52.550
My dear?!

05:03.780 --> 05:07.500
Look how mercilessly he fights for me!

05:08.040 --> 05:13.210
Even though there's no way a human could
physically hurt a djinn who can use all magic!

05:13.590 --> 05:15.460
I don't want to kill you.

05:16.300 --> 05:19.300
I've never liked fighting.

05:20.130 --> 05:24.600
I don't want to kill someone
who's already surrendered, that's all.

05:26.680 --> 05:28.560
Is he fighting for me?

05:48.910 --> 05:50.910
Forgive... me...

05:50.910 --> 05:54.500
No, you hurt Rys.

05:58.710 --> 06:00.170
Stop it!

06:00.170 --> 06:02.380
Stop it, my dear!

06:03.340 --> 06:10.060
I'm happy that you're angry for my sake.

06:10.060 --> 06:12.850
Even so, I wonder why...

06:12.850 --> 06:18.360
Your refusal to kill an opponent
who surrendered brought me to you.

06:18.720 --> 06:24.990
I couldn't bear it if you lost
that kindness because of me.

06:27.200 --> 06:28.290
Rys...

06:33.600 --> 06:35.010
My dear...

06:39.960 --> 06:41.250
It's warm.

06:42.090 --> 06:45.570
As you see, I am safe, my dear.

06:46.030 --> 06:47.320
Thank goodness.

06:48.350 --> 06:49.100
Thank goodness!

06:51.180 --> 06:52.490
Rys!

07:08.820 --> 07:10.280
Is everyone okay?

07:10.280 --> 07:11.580
Y-Yes, Princess.

07:11.950 --> 07:14.120
I'm sorry for asking too much.

07:14.120 --> 07:18.380
I know it's tough to cast Teleportation
when your magic is still recovering.

07:18.380 --> 07:20.540
Not at all. It's fine.

07:20.950 --> 07:26.430
If we had more magic to use,
we'd be able to take you to the next town.

07:27.890 --> 07:30.180
Don't let anything disturb their rest.

07:30.180 --> 07:30.810
Understood!

07:30.810 --> 07:36.020
We've to search for the true hero
by asking around steadily.

07:39.710 --> 07:41.570
The Collar of Sacrifice is gone?

07:41.570 --> 07:44.240
What does this mean?

07:45.150 --> 07:49.650
Could it be that the djinn
was unable to grant the wish?

07:51.620 --> 07:53.120
We know you're inside!

07:53.120 --> 07:54.580
Come out now!

07:54.580 --> 07:58.290
Don't try to resist! We are ordered
to bring you before the First Princess!

07:58.290 --> 08:01.040
What do we do, Sir Hero?

08:01.040 --> 08:04.880
If they catch us,
we'll be executed.

08:04.880 --> 08:08.970
Was that djinn lying about
making any wishes come true?!

08:08.970 --> 08:12.260
Wow, the djinn has failed
to grant a wish.

08:12.260 --> 08:14.270
Sir Hero!

08:14.270 --> 08:16.310
There's a fine offering here.

08:16.310 --> 08:18.980
What is going on here?

08:20.060 --> 08:20.600
Tsuya!

08:21.690 --> 08:23.730
Finally, I got out of there.

08:23.730 --> 08:24.730
Tsuya?

08:24.730 --> 08:30.070
A real body after being sealed
for centuries. Not bad.

08:30.070 --> 08:32.280
- Hey, you...
- But these clothes aren't to my taste.

08:37.000 --> 08:38.620
This will do.

08:38.620 --> 08:41.580
Tsuya, you could use magic?

08:42.080 --> 08:46.300
I must show my gratitude for releasing
that persky djinn's seal.

08:46.720 --> 08:49.630
Thanks to you, I got out like this.

08:49.630 --> 08:53.050
Well then, Golden-Haired Hero.

08:53.470 --> 09:00.440
This Grand Magus of Midnight Damalynas
will grant you the power you want.

09:10.950 --> 09:16.080
Good! This is much better than
that stupid face you had before.

09:19.620 --> 09:21.210
Okay, let's go!

09:21.210 --> 09:26.880
It's time to punish those foolish
royal family for sealing me away.

09:28.610 --> 09:30.260
A teleportation circle?

09:30.260 --> 09:32.840
The royal family that sealed me...

09:32.840 --> 09:35.180
No matter if it's their
descendants or heirs,

09:35.180 --> 09:38.130
nobody won't get away from me.

09:54.050 --> 09:55.200
Are you finally awake?

09:57.030 --> 09:58.810
Please have mercy on me!

10:01.080 --> 10:03.580
Why did you heal me?

10:03.580 --> 10:06.590
Because Rys is fine.

10:07.290 --> 10:11.010
Sir Flio, what are you going
to do with this djinn?

10:11.010 --> 10:14.470
I think she can't be left
to the local guards or even the Knights.

10:15.950 --> 10:16.930
You're right.

10:17.350 --> 10:20.350
It might be good to seal her again
in the castle's treasury.

10:20.350 --> 10:21.390
How do you know that?

10:22.120 --> 10:25.730
It seems that the list of spells
I can use has increased.

10:25.730 --> 10:31.430
I wanted to know the reason why were you
attacking us, so I peeked into your head.

10:41.290 --> 10:43.460
Memory-Reading?

10:43.460 --> 10:47.170
He can use a spell that only I can?

10:47.710 --> 10:52.260
You're a djinn who is able to grant
a wish in exchange for many lives.

10:52.260 --> 10:57.140
If I return you to the castle,
the same thing could happen again.

10:57.140 --> 10:59.350
Then, what should we do?

10:59.350 --> 11:01.720
There's an easy solution!

11:02.350 --> 11:05.560
From now on,
you'll be my husband's servant!

11:05.560 --> 11:06.310
Huh?

11:06.310 --> 11:08.230
Rys, I don't need—

11:08.230 --> 11:13.610
I know you don't want anybody
to serve you.

11:13.610 --> 11:19.950
However, if we can't rely on the castle,
it's better to keep her close to us.

11:20.410 --> 11:21.240
Rys...

11:21.240 --> 11:25.580
And if a strong djinn like her
joins our pack...

11:25.580 --> 11:28.250
She's going to be a good asset.

11:28.250 --> 11:31.880
Rys, you've gotten good at persuasion.

11:31.880 --> 11:33.920
But your true intention is leaking out.

11:35.050 --> 11:39.180
I... I... I know that power isn't everything.

11:39.180 --> 11:44.480
Even so, a strong member
could help the whole pack...

11:45.850 --> 11:50.150
Are you sure even though she was
the one who injured you?

11:54.820 --> 11:56.200
Lady Rys?

11:56.200 --> 11:58.660
You don't have to force yourself.

12:01.740 --> 12:04.750
It's really frustrating!

12:04.750 --> 12:08.830
But I lost because of my own weakness.

12:11.210 --> 12:16.300
If Rys says so, then there's no point
in keeping holding a grudge.

12:19.020 --> 12:24.560
Take my hand if you swear
that you'll never take someone's life again.

12:25.210 --> 12:27.730
If you do, I'll forgive you.

12:27.730 --> 12:28.980
What do you say?

12:29.730 --> 12:38.200
Humans are greedy creatures
that want to satisfy their desires at any cost,

12:38.200 --> 12:40.890
or so I thought.

12:41.450 --> 12:43.480
How interesting.

12:48.580 --> 12:51.330
Exalted One, Lord Flio.

12:51.750 --> 12:55.550
I would like to see what you,
the Transcendence,

12:55.550 --> 13:00.930
who wields all the power of this world,
desire and what you'll accomplish.

13:00.930 --> 13:06.680
Henceforth, I pledge my powers
and my body under your care.

13:09.060 --> 13:11.940
Sorry for getting carried away, too.

13:11.940 --> 13:14.690
There's no need for you to apologize.

13:18.570 --> 13:23.150
Why do I feel such a thrill
just remembering those eyes?

13:24.870 --> 13:28.580
Did you just think of something creepy?

13:28.580 --> 13:30.330
No, nothing like that.

13:30.330 --> 13:32.920
Then why is your face so red?

13:32.920 --> 13:34.420
Um... Rys?

13:36.630 --> 13:39.380
We need to get this area back to normal.

13:40.090 --> 13:46.510
Oh, right. I wonder if I can use
the Time-Reversal spell like I used on Rys.

13:46.510 --> 13:48.310
Please wait a minute.

13:48.310 --> 13:54.020
Forgive me for being rude, but I'd like
to ask you not to use that spell again.

13:54.020 --> 13:56.000
Huh? Why not?

13:56.610 --> 13:59.940
This might get a little complicated.

14:00.660 --> 14:05.990
That spell only moves time
within a specified area.

14:05.990 --> 14:09.580
Therefore, it is easy for unforeseen
accidents to occur

14:09.580 --> 14:12.040
due to discrepancies between the areas.

14:12.460 --> 14:18.000
Even if I were to use it,
I would limit its effect to a single person.

14:18.420 --> 14:22.470
After all, it is a spell that is never
meant for a human to use.

14:22.470 --> 14:24.470
Then, how can I...

14:24.860 --> 14:29.060
I have seen your stats, Exalted One.
You possess infinite skills.

14:29.520 --> 14:30.720
Infinite?

14:30.720 --> 14:33.850
Do you mean that symbol?

14:36.440 --> 14:38.320
As long you have it,

14:38.320 --> 14:44.700
you can use Total Acquisition Magic
that only a Transcendence can use.

14:44.700 --> 14:46.740
Total Acquisition Magic?

14:46.740 --> 14:47.530
Yes.

14:47.530 --> 14:49.510
Once you're hit by a spell,

14:49.510 --> 14:53.790
you can use that spell along with
its entire types of magic.

14:54.170 --> 14:57.080
In other words,
since I was hit by your spell,

14:57.080 --> 15:01.340
I can use types of magic
that normally only djinns can use?

15:01.340 --> 15:02.800
That is right.

15:02.800 --> 15:07.590
But as I said before, using the Time-Reversal
spell will cause accidents.

15:08.260 --> 15:11.060
So please do not use it again.

15:11.060 --> 15:12.350
I understand.

15:12.350 --> 15:15.450
Then I will use Restoration spell
to fix this.

15:28.280 --> 15:33.040
I am Hiya, the djinn who commands
primordial light and darkness.

15:33.420 --> 15:39.470
As a servant of the Exalted One,
I am going to live here starting today.

15:40.040 --> 15:41.510
Pleased to meet you all.

15:42.300 --> 15:45.220
A djinn? F-For real?

15:45.220 --> 15:47.890
After the Dark One, now is a djinn?

15:47.890 --> 15:50.010
To think djinns actually exist...

15:50.010 --> 15:53.850
She doesn't have any place to live,
so I brought her here.

15:54.250 --> 15:58.190
Brought her here?! You make it
sound like picking a stray cat.

15:59.480 --> 16:01.270
I've prepared your room.

16:03.150 --> 16:08.320
Are we going to be okay to live
together with a djinn, Balirossa?

16:08.320 --> 16:11.280
As long as Sir Flio is here,
we're going to be okay.

16:11.280 --> 16:12.990
Are you really sure?

16:13.410 --> 16:16.770
Now, let me show you your room.
Come here.

16:45.070 --> 16:48.150
Sir Flio, what's wrong?

16:48.580 --> 16:52.280
No, I was just thinking of something.

16:52.280 --> 16:53.870
I see.

16:54.870 --> 16:56.340
I'm sorry for today.

16:56.950 --> 16:59.580
You must be scared during the day.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.540
No, I didn't...

17:03.290 --> 17:05.839
Even if I was told to have
a great power,

17:05.839 --> 17:09.130
I don't know how to make use
of that power.

17:09.970 --> 17:13.470
How to make use of your power?

17:13.470 --> 17:18.230
I don't have the same power as you,
but I also have the same confusion.

17:18.890 --> 17:21.480
Those I thought were my enemies
turned out not to be so,

17:21.480 --> 17:24.480
and those I thought were allies
turned out not to be so.

17:25.650 --> 17:29.460
I am wondering for what purpose
am I trying to be strong,

17:30.070 --> 17:32.660
and to whom should I point my sword.

17:33.280 --> 17:38.870
Had I not met both of you,
I wouldn't have had to wonder like this.

17:40.830 --> 17:43.750
Still, I am grateful to both of you.

17:44.710 --> 17:50.170
You two made me realize what I thought
was natural turned out to be different.

17:59.850 --> 18:02.520
We have been through a lot today.

18:02.520 --> 18:03.980
Are you okay?

18:04.900 --> 18:05.940
Yes.

18:06.440 --> 18:08.960
You look a bit down.
Is something wrong?

18:10.360 --> 18:11.880
Are you really okay?

18:14.360 --> 18:15.240
Rys?

18:18.160 --> 18:22.410
Do you intend to return to your world?

18:23.750 --> 18:25.500
Why would you think that?

18:26.710 --> 18:28.750
It's what Hiya said.

18:28.750 --> 18:34.610
About how you can cast any type of spells
that you've been hit with.

18:36.090 --> 18:38.060
Yeah, it seems so.

18:38.060 --> 18:44.810
Now that you can use djinn magic,
does that mean you can go home now?

18:49.110 --> 18:50.940
Please take me with you!

18:50.940 --> 18:55.450
I'll go anywhere you go!

18:55.450 --> 18:59.580
So please don't leave me behind!

19:04.710 --> 19:05.880
Rys.

19:08.630 --> 19:10.370
I'm not going to return.

19:15.380 --> 19:20.470
That place is no place for
a demihuman like you.

19:20.470 --> 19:22.970
And I'm not planning to return
while leaving you behind.

19:25.110 --> 19:26.240
But...

19:27.190 --> 19:32.780
Rys, let me ask you again.
Will you be my wife for real this time?

19:33.570 --> 19:39.780
During the day, when I thought
I'd lost you, I was really scared.

19:39.780 --> 19:43.160
I've never been so shaken up before.

19:43.160 --> 19:45.910
I couldn't control myself.

19:51.090 --> 19:53.960
We were only a married couple
in name before,

19:53.960 --> 19:58.430
but I can't think of a life
without you anymore.

19:58.430 --> 19:59.970
My dear...

20:00.340 --> 20:05.770
I always thought of us to be a real
married couple since the start.

20:05.770 --> 20:07.060
Rys...

20:11.480 --> 20:16.190
I've only been taught
how to fight and lead a pack.

20:16.190 --> 20:20.950
But I learned so many feelings
after I met you.

20:42.370 --> 20:43.540
My dear...

20:44.850 --> 20:50.770
You said before that you adopted
this appearance to escape from the castle.

20:50.770 --> 20:55.030
But now, there's no need for you to hide.

20:55.030 --> 21:00.170
No, this Flio is who I am in this world.

21:00.850 --> 21:05.870
As long as you know, then my old name
and appearance can stay in the past.

21:06.830 --> 21:08.410
My dear...

21:20.720 --> 21:23.970
Hiya?! H-How long have you been there?

21:23.970 --> 21:26.680
From the moment
you two sat down on the bed.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.930
Then you've been here since the start?!

21:28.930 --> 21:30.440
Naturally.

21:30.440 --> 21:34.150
It is my duty to know the Exalted One's
whereabouts all the time.

21:34.150 --> 21:35.900
I have to keep observing him.

21:35.900 --> 21:36.610
Huh?!

21:36.610 --> 21:38.900
You are forbidden to do it from now on!

21:38.900 --> 21:40.530
Don't spy on people's private lives!

21:40.530 --> 21:42.490
There is nothing to hide.

21:42.490 --> 21:43.870
Mating is a natural beha—

21:43.870 --> 21:46.830
You have to learn some common sense
if you want to live together!

21:47.200 --> 21:48.540
Damn you, Hiya!

21:48.540 --> 21:49.790
I won't forgive you!

21:49.790 --> 21:51.000
Calm down!

21:51.000 --> 21:54.000
You should keep your voice low
when you have such a conversation.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.460
It's piping hot there.

21:55.460 --> 21:57.420
Belano, better not listen, okay?

21:57.420 --> 21:59.920
I'm not a kid anymore, it's fine.

22:01.170 --> 22:06.140
Then, I will make myself invisible
so as not to disturb you next time.

22:06.140 --> 22:08.600
You can't!

23:40.610 --> 23:43.900
You finally stopped being
a human, Sir Hero.

23:43.900 --> 23:47.700
Isn't it bad for this anime,
which is made of my attractiveness?

23:47.700 --> 23:51.910
Whether you become a monster or not,
there's not much change at all.

23:51.910 --> 23:53.370
Is that so?

23:53.370 --> 23:56.310
So I still have my attractiveness
even if I've become a monster?

23:56.310 --> 23:57.120
I'm not complimenting you, Sir Hero.

23:57.120 --> 24:00.000
NEXT EPISODE: TO EACH OF OUR FUTURES
I'm not complimenting you, Sir Hero.
